  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.7.0 adds richer link interactions, typed node lifecycle hooks, and two new desktop demo playgrounds.\n\n## Highlights\n\n### Link interactions\n- Style hover and press states without sacrificing text selection or wrapping.\n- Use `LinkPointerOverChanged` and `GetInlineGeometry` to anchor tooltips or previews to the right fragment of a wrapped link. Click handlers can now access the `Link` instance directly.\n\n### Node lifecycle hooks\n- Register typed `initialize`, `beforeUpdate`, `afterUpdate`, and `cleanup` callbacks through `renderer.NodeHooks` or `MarkdownNode.GlobalHooks`.\n- Use hooks to keep customizations, such as inline icons, across streaming updates. Dispose the registration to clean up live nodes.\n\n### Desktop demo\n- Web links show progressive hover previews across the demo. Favicons update both the card and the inline link without waiting for the cover image.\n- Local links reveal files in the system file manager on click. Right-click for actions such as opening, choosing an app, copying the path, or saving a copy.\n- The **Link** and **Hooks** playgrounds show these interactions and how hooks behave during streaming and cleanup.\n\n## Compatibility\n\nExisting link commands and context menus continue to work. Web previews and native file actions are implemented by the desktop demo; the library provides the APIs hosts need to build their own.\n\n**Full changelog:** [[v2.6.1…v2.7.0](https://github.com/DearVa/LiveMarkdown.Avalonia/compare/v2.6.1...v2.7.0)](https://github.com/DearVa/LiveMarkdown.Avalonia/compare/v2.6.1...v2.7.0)",
